            "sid": "EXO 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The whole Israelite community left the desert of Sin, moving from one place to another at the command of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". They made camp at Rephidim, but there was no water there to drink. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They complained to Moses and said, “Give us water to drink.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses answered, “Why are you complaining? Why are you putting the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to the test?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the people were very thirsty and continued to complain to Moses. They said, “Why did you bring us out of Egypt? To kill us and our children and our livestock with thirst?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses prayed earnestly to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and said, “What can I do with these people? They are almost ready to stone me.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Take some of the leaders of Israel with you, and go on ahead of the people. Take along the stick with which you struck the Nile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will stand before you on a rock at Mount Sinai. Strike the rock, and water will come out of it for the people to drink.” Moses did so in the presence of the leaders of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
