          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Amalekites came and attacked the Israelites at Rephidim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses said to Joshua, “Pick out some men to go and fight the Amalekites tomorrow. I will stand on top of the hill holding the stick that God told me to carry.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua did as Moses commanded him and went out to fight the Amalekites, while Moses, Aaron, and Hur went up to the top of the hill. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As long as Moses held up his arms, the Israelites won, but when he put his arms down, the Amalekites started winning. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Moses' arms grew tired, Aaron and Hur brought a stone for him to sit on, while they stood beside him and held up his arms, holding them steady until the sun went down. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In this way Joshua totally defeated the Amalekites.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
